PREAMBLE

The Quran is received through oral transmission (mushafahah) at the hands
of proficient, authorized teachers. Software may assist a learner, but it
must never be presented as a substitute for Expert Quran Teacher.

This License therefore uses the permissive Apache License, Version 2.0 as
its base, and adds the Additional Conditions set out in Section 2: a
mandatory AI advisory notice, adherence to the rulings of Islamic Sharia,
an absolute prohibition on advertisements, and a guaranteed free-access
path for those who cannot pay.

